 "reporting": "Number tested, number resistant and % resistant by organism and specimen (blood, urine, pus aspirate, other sterile body fluids), all locations pooled; % resistant by location (OPD, IPD, ICU), all specimens pooled, as chart data labels without numbers tested. Isolate counts by specimen and by location.",
 "method": "12 government medical college laboratories in Assam; WHONET; NCDC AMR surveillance SOPs; CLSI; first isolate per patient, pathogen and specimen type in a hospital stay; pus aspirates from closed infected sites only (swabs excluded); vancomycin screen agar and broth microdilution; colistin broth microdilution in several laboratories.",
